# The Product Knowledge database used to be shipped with the code, and this is
# where the exception that allowed it lived. It no longer is. The artifact
# built by the Product Facts project grew from 57 MiB to 135 MiB, past the
# 100 MiB file that GitHub refuses outright, so the repository can no longer
# carry it even if we wanted to.
#
# It is now a manually deployed artifact rather than a tracked file:
#
#   상품DB PC  builds and quality-gates the database, and publishes its SHA-256
#   개발 PC    holds a byte-identical copy at data/product_facts.db
#   서버 PC    receives the same file by hand, verified by the same SHA-256
#
# Nothing about how the code reads it changed -- ProductFactRepository still
# opens data/product_facts.db read-only, and OJE_PRODUCT_FACTS_DB_PATH still
# overrides that path. What changed is that git pull no longer delivers or
# removes the file, so a deploy cannot silently replace the knowledge base.
# The *.db rule above already covers it, along with the versioned copies and
# the pre-switch backups kept beside it.

data/backups/
data/dps_agent_state.json
data/dps_connection.json
data/dps_windows_cache.json
data/chrome*/
data/*cookie*.json
data/*session*.json
chrome-profile/
chrome_profile/
user-data-dir/

# Local IDE / operating-system artifacts
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Local legacy handoff notes superseded by README/DEPLOYMENT
CHATGPT_FINAL_COMPLETION_NOTES.txt
PATCH_README.txt

# Read-only production diagnostics. These hold real customer inquiry text,
# product ids and answer bodies pulled from the operational DB, so they stay
# local: useful while investigating, never part of the repository.
gate_*.txt
diagnose_*_output.txt
*_gate.txt

# 운영 데이터가 담긴 Excel Export 결과물 (scripts/export_qa_learning_excel.py)
exports/

# Single-inquiry diagnostic exports. Masked, but still customer text:
# they are produced to be read and deleted, not versioned.
diagnostics/

# 서버 PC에서 복사해 온 운영 스냅샷(약 955MB). 개발 PC에서는 분석용으로 계속
# 필요하므로 그대로 두되, 저장소에는 넣지 않는다. 위쪽 *.db 규칙은 안에 든
# oje_automation.db / product_facts.db 만 가리고, 같이 들어 있는 Catalog 사본과
# DPS 캐시 JSON 은 걸러지지 않으므로 폴더째 지정한다.
data/서버pc_data/

# COHORT 1~3 검증 산출물. 지금까지 Git 으로 관리된 적이 없고, observation dump
# 와 selection 파일에는 운영 DB 에서 그대로 뽑은 고객 문의 원문·주문번호·답변
# 본문이 들어 있다. diagnostics/ · exports/ 와 같은 이유로 로컬에만 남긴다.
# 재현에 필요한 selection rule 과 oracle 도 같은 폴더에 있으므로 개발 PC 에서
# 삭제하지 말 것.
.verification/

# 테스트 실행 marker. 실행할 때마다 다시 만들어지는 1바이트 산출물이다.
*.exitcode.txt
